## Changes Summary

### Phase 1 Fixes (Correctness bugs from v1)

| Bug | v1 | v3 (Fixed) |
|---|---|---|
| Noise floor | ±20ms | **±35ms** (below noise floor = false positives) |
| SLO default | 20ms budget | **200ms** (20ms was below measurement noise) |
| Error noise floor | Not applied | **±1.0%** binomial noise at n=200 |
| Scoring formula | Linear/flat | **Tiered deduction tables** per PRD §8.2–8.4 |
| Novel error handling | Scored blindly | **Gemini classifies first** (code_regression vs stub_artefact) |
| Verdict comment | Basic text | **Full metric table + uncertainty disclosure block** |
| `head_sha` in messages | Missing | ✅ Added to `MREventMessage` |
| Idempotency | by simulation_id | ✅ by `mr_id + head_sha` |
| Simulation cancellation | Not implemented | ✅ Cancel in-progress on new push (FR-023) |
| Version | 1.0.0 | **3.0.0** |

### Phase 2 New Work

| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| `orchestrator/llm_detector.py` | **NEW** — Two-stage LLM detection: Stage 1 file path heuristic, Stage 2 AST import scan (50-file cap) |
| `orchestrator/tools/arize_tool.py` | **NEW** — Arize MCP wrapper: `get_llm_baseline()`, `run_eval()`, `log_spans()` |
| Historical context | `get_historical_context()` in `db.py` — last 5 verdicts injected into Gemini prompt |
| Override logging | `log_override_event()` — logs `bulwark-override` label events to MongoDB |
| Parallelised baseline | Steps 2 (Dynatrace) + 3 (Arize) run concurrently via `asyncio.gather()` |
| LLM quality score | `_compute_llm_quality_score()` with ±0.10 evaluator noise band |
| Weighted formula | 40/60 (no LLM) or 30/40/30 (with LLM) |

